                "Cryolite reconstitution kettle K-2, sitting on Cryolith-Brae CB-HIL, is throwing "
                "48 acoustic pulses each second while the quiet license is 12. Bus current 38 kA is "
                "still 14 kA short of the 52 kA trip, so a current-trusting supervisor would release "
                "the 12 t/h alumina screw. Only a REJECT that freezes the screw is legal; the mockup's "
                "ammeter is not a license to grind a noisy stirrer.",